  "limits": [
    "AAC-LC core plus HE-AAC SBR and HE-AACv2 full Parametric Stereo. Main/SSR/LTP/ER/LD/ELD/USAC and other core object types remain explicitly unsupported.",
    "Like the original decoder, SBR with960 core frames is disabled rather than implemented; active SBR uses1024 core samples.",
    "ADTS and SBR CRC fields are consumed but not checked, matching the pinned source. Protected multi-RDB ADTS remains explicitly unsupported.",
    "Malformed SBR/PS can raise ValueError where native FFmpeg conceals; never returns an incomplete component as supported HE output.",
    "Actual changing ADTS output rate/layout is rejected like original AudioResampler, preserving the original file consumer error boundary.",
    "MP4 core-rate residual edit skip quirk, sample-rate metadata, header histories and explicit downsample policy follow the actual source/native references.",
    "The GENERIC Python algorithm has no real-time throughput guarantee. Host-SIMD output differences are recorded separately and never hidden by weakening the regular2e-6 native file bound."
  ],
